<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 3</span> </span>Deriving per-path, per-type throughput from executor-level throughput profiling results.</figcaption>
